The maritime network files (data/marnet.cjs, data/marnet-50km.cjs,
data/marnet-20km.cjs) are derived from the Eurostat searoute network,
https://github.com/eurostat/searoute, licensed under the EUPL-1.2. The full
licence text is in LICENSES/EUPL-1.2.txt.

The marnet networks in this package are modified from the Eurostat originals
(EUPL-1.2, Art. 5). The GeoPackage files were converted to GeoJSON and then to a
JSON-string CommonJS asset by scripts/build-marnet.cjs, with vertices at
longitude 180 rewritten to -180.

Port data (src/ports/data.ts) is derived from marchah/sea-ports, licensed under
the MIT licence.

